<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Merrill raises Veeco.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Merrill raises Veeco.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it upgraded its near-term rating on Veeco Instruments Inc to buy from accumulate, keeping it as a long-term buy.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- The stock rose 7/8 to 26-5/8 in early trade.</p>
